{"text":"Whole-outcome correction replacing unclaimed 61bdd92b for audit55563589/reviewf24d2b56. Builder: documentation and repository hygiene (simplification review 55563589, findings CRUFT-03, CRUFT-08, CRUFT-09, CRUFT-10, CRUFT-11, CRUFT-05, LAYER-09). (1) docs/protocol.md: sections 24 to 30 are 1,099 of 3,244 lines and define 14 rules inside amendment text; R-LOG-9 and R-CARRY-6, -9, -10 are superseded without a forward pointer; open points 38 and 40 live inside amendments. Fold each amended rule into place, move sections 24 to 30 into a short history appendix of rule-ID lists, gather all open points in section 22. (2) Package READMEs total 4,372 lines; room's is 1,719 with 23 review and amendment sections before its reference material; 27 test files are named after review IDs. Rewrite each README as current-state reference with the deltas in a CHANGELOG, and rename tests by behaviour keeping the review ID in a describe string. (3) 68 tracked result files (1.4 MB) of which only two logbig files are read by code, from another package's directory (git/test/push-outcome.test.ts:41-42); move those two into git/test/fixtures and delete or archive the 13 referenced by nothing. (4) spikes/room-core and spikes/sandbox-git are superseded with no status line and their own lockfiles; spikes/pi-durable vendors the Room and client at revisions 284 commits behind main. Add a status header to each spike README naming what replaced it, archive the two superseded spikes to a tag, and either re-pin or mark pi-durable frozen. (5) notes/ has no index; notes/mcp-stage0.md:3 and notes/2026-10-01-pi-durable.md:9 cite notes that exist only on unmerged branches; the plan cites docs/runtime-profile.md which was never created; laneF-carry, laneL-carry and amendment4-log are delivery reports now covered elsewhere. Add notes/README.md with a status per note and fix or remove the dangling links. (6) The deployed UI always builds the mock (ui/src/main.tsx:22) and its comments say the client's